6 W (12V, 0.13A)</li><li>Weight: 175g</li></ul><h3>Design Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Sleek white finish for a clean look in modern PC builds</li><li>Daisy-chain 8-pin connector for easier cable management</li><li>Upgraded connectors for more secure, reliable setup</li><li>Durable materials: PBT frame and polycarbonate blades</li><li>Rubber padding on all corners to reduce vibration and noise</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/deepcool-fk120-high-performance-120mm-casing-cooling-fan\">Deepcool FK120 120mm Casing Cooling Fan</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                                                            1,050৳\n                                                         \n                        </p>                      \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/deepcool-fk120-3-i